Comment: 1,0:01:37.07,0:01:37.07,OPCN,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:51.07,0:01:53.61,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,与众生迥异之身
Comment: 0,0:01:53.61,0:01:56.02,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,扭曲情绪隐匿于假面之中
Comment: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.13,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,无法抑止之冲动
Comment: 0,0:01:58.13,0:02:01.01,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,欲将真实与虚妄尽数击碎
Comment: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:03.15,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,跨越那既定之轨道
Comment: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:05.89,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,因命运将使我等再度相逢
Comment: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:08.47,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,胜于世间万物
Comment: 0,0:02:08.47,0:02:11.09,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,此刻胸中的我更觉昂扬
Comment: 0,0:02:11.09,0:02:13.40,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,言语难以传达啊愚顽之徒
Comment: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:16.00,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,擂台钟岂容久候
Comment: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:18.47,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,我挚爱的沙袋
Comment: 0,0:02:18.47,0:02:22.79,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,绝不手下留情
Comment: 0,0:02:22.79,0:02:25.40,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,此血奔涌于身躯之间
Comment: 0,0:02:25.40,0:02:27.77,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,沸腾而燃
Comment: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:30.10,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,不为他人言语所役
Comment: 0,0:02:30.10,0:02:32.85,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,而自立生存
Comment: 0,0:02:32.85,0:02:35.27,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不曾有败北之念
Comment: 0,0:02:35.27,0:02:37.59,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,直至此身朽灭
Comment: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:40.19,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,亦曾立誓奉献
Comment: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:42.59,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,只为那不属于任何人的你
Comment: 0,0:02:42.69,0:02:45.28,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,于战场之上芳华飞舞
Comment: 0,0:02:45.38,0:02:47.57,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,美艳傲放
Comment: 0,0:02:47.57,0:02:50.02,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,从不需他人援手
Comment: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:52.55,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,直至与你相遇
Comment: 0,0:02:52.55,0:02:55.07,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不曾有败北之念
Comment: 0,0:02:55.07,0:02:57.49,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,直至此身朽灭
Comment: 0,0:02:57.49,0:02:59.97,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,亦曾立誓奉献
Comment: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:02.47,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,只为那不属于任何人的你
Comment: 0,0:03:02.47,0:03:05.00,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,如初吻般
Comment: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:08.07,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,不灭的这份我亦将永恒
Comment: 1,0:01:37.07,0:01:37.07,OPCN,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:51.07,0:01:53.61,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,与众生迥异之身
Comment: 0,0:01:53.61,0:01:56.02,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,扭曲情绪隐匿于假面之中
Comment: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.13,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,无法抑止之冲动
Comment: 0,0:01:58.13,0:02:01.01,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,欲将真实与虚妄尽数击碎
Comment: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:03.15,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,跨越那既定之轨道
Comment: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:05.89,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,因命运将使我等再度相逢
Comment: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:08.47,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,胜于世间万物
Comment: 0,0:02:08.47,0:02:11.09,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,此刻胸中的我更觉昂扬
Comment: 0,0:02:11.09,0:02:13.40,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,言语难以传达啊愚顽之徒
Comment: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:16.00,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,擂台钟岂容久候
Comment: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:18.47,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,我挚爱的沙袋
Comment: 0,0:02:18.47,0:02:22.79,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,绝不手下留情
Comment: 0,0:02:22.79,0:02:25.40,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,此血奔涌于身躯之间
Comment: 0,0:02:25.40,0:02:27.77,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,沸腾而燃
Comment: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:30.10,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,不为他人言语所役
Comment: 0,0:02:30.10,0:02:32.85,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,而自立生存
Comment: 0,0:02:32.85,0:02:35.27,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不曾有败北之念
Comment: 0,0:02:35.27,0:02:37.59,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,直至此身朽灭
Comment: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:40.19,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,亦曾立誓奉献
Comment: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:42.59,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,只为那不属于任何人的你
Comment: 0,0:02:42.69,0:02:45.28,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,于战场之上芳华飞舞
Comment: 0,0:02:45.38,0:02:47.57,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,美艳傲放
Comment: 0,0:02:47.57,0:02:50.02,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,从不需他人援手
Comment: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:52.55,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,直至与你相遇
Comment: 0,0:02:52.55,0:02:55.07,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不曾有败北之念
Comment: 0,0:02:55.07,0:02:57.49,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,直至此身朽灭
Comment: 0,0:02:57.49,0:02:59.97,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,亦曾立誓奉献
Comment: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:02.47,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,只为那不属于任何人的你
Comment: 0,0:03:02.47,0:03:05.00,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,如初吻般
Comment: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:08.07,OPCN2,,0,0,0,karaoke,不灭的这份我亦将永恒
